BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai-observability-switzerland-webinar-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261114T120409Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261117T110000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261117T120000
SUMMARY:AI Observability Switzerland — Giving Your AI Systems the Visibil
 ity They Deserve
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:An hour for engineering\, platform and data teams on tracking d
 own rising token costs\, stuck agent chains and slower model responses —
  monitoring LLM calls without custom instrumentation\, tracing agent chain
 s with OpenTelemetry\, and setting up continuous evaluation to catch quali
 ty drops.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss Digital Network (Effective SRE & DevOps Comm
 unity) with Grafana Labs\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataeve
 nts.ch/events/ai-observability-switzerland-webinar-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/ai-observability-switzerland-webinar-
 2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
