 een chatbots\, assistants and agents\, how to write a prompt that works\, 
 and how to make a model check its own output.\n\nOrganiser: AI4ALL Switzer
 land\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/ai4all
 -lunch-learn-prompting-2026/
